    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντᾰγων-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>opponent, competitor, rival,</i>
